#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this chapter we provide an overview of the core features and the workflow "
"of &rocs;. For the eager reader, who wants to start using &rocs; "
"immediately, we suggest to read at least <xref linkend=\"introduction-"
"nutshell\"/> and using <xref linkend=\"scripting\"/> as a reference when "
"writing algorithms."
msgstr ""
"U ovom odjeljku omogućavamo pregled suštinskih dodataka i tok rada &rocs;. "
"Za čitača, koji želi započeti korištenje &rocs; odmah, preporučujemo da bar "
"pročita <xref linkend=\"introduction-nutshell\"/> i koristi <xref linkend="
"\"scripting\"/> kao referencu za pisanje algoritama."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Goals, Target Audience and Workflow"
msgstr "Ciljevi, ciljani auditorijum i Tok rada"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&rocs; is a Graph Theory IDE for everybody interested in designing and "
"analyzing graph algorithms. This explicitly includes"
msgstr ""
"&rocs; je Teorija Grafova IDE za svakoga zainteresovanog za dizajniranje i "
"analiziranje graf algoritama. Ovo uključuje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "lecturers, who want to demonstrate algorithms to their students,"
msgstr "predavači, koji žele demonstrirati algoritme svojim studentima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "students, who want to understand and see how their algorithm perform,"
msgstr "studenti, koji žele razumjeti i vidjeti kako njihov algoritam radi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "and everybody, who is interested in data structures and algorithms."
msgstr "i svako, koga zanimaju strukture podataka i algoritmi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For all these users, &rocs; provides an easy to use data structure editor "
"for creating the data structures, a powerful scripting engine to execute "
"algorithms, and several helper tools for your simulations and experiments."
msgstr ""
"Za sve korisnike , &rocs; obezbjeđuje laku upotrebu editora struktura "
"podataka za kreiranje struktura podataka,  moćni pogon za skriptanje i "
"izvršavanje algoritama, i više pomoćnih alata za simulacije i eksperimente."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The typical workflow when using &rocs; is to start by creating a graph with "
"the visual graph editor. You can do this either by hand, this is adding data "
"elements and connect them, or by using one of the data structure generators "
"(if available for the currently selected data structure backend). Data "
"structure generators can be found at <menuchoice><guimenu>Graph Document</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Tools</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Generate Graph</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Further, you can assign values to the data "
"structure elements, either by hand or using <menuchoice><guimenu>Graph "
"Document</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Tools</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Assign "
"Values</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Finally, you can write your algorithm in "
"JavaScript and execute it with the just created data structure. All changes "
"that your algorithm perform at the data structure will be directly visible "
"at the visual graph editor."
msgstr ""
"Tipičan radni tok &rocs; počinje kreiranjem grafa sa vizualnim editorom "
"grafova. Možete to uraditi ručno dodavanjem podatkovnih elemenata i njihovim "
"povezivanjem, ili korištenjem nekog oda generatora struktura podataka (ako "
"je dostupno za podršku trenutno odabranim strukturama podataka). Generatore "
"struktura podataka možete pronaći na <menuchoice><guimenu>Graf dokument</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Alati</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Generiši graf</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Zatim možete dodijeliti vrijednostima elementima "
"strukture podataka, ručno ili korištenjem<menuchoice><guimenu>Graf "
"dokumenti</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Alati</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Dodijeli "
"vrijednosti</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Na kraju, možete napisati vaš "
"algoritam u JavaScript-u i izvršiti ga sa kreiranom strukturom podataka.Sve "
"promjene koj izvodi vaš algoritam sa strukturama podataka će direktno biti "
"vidljive na vizualnom graf editoru."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>A Screenshot of &rocs;.</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Snimak ekrana &rocs;.</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A Screenshot of &rocs;.</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Snimak ekrana &rocs;.</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "&rocs; in a Nutshell"
msgstr "&rocs; u Ljusci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this section we provide a compact overview of the core elements of "
"&rocs;. We explain the important notions of data structures, data structure "
"backends, and element types. Understanding of these concepts is useful to "
"understand how data structures can be created and modified in &rocs;."
msgstr ""
"U ovom dijelu omogućujemo sažet pregled osnovnih elemenata &rocs;. "
"Objašnjena su bitna obilježja struktura podataka, podrška strukturama "
"podataka, i tipovi elemenata. Razumjevanje ovi koncepata je korisno za "
"razumjevanje kako strukture podataka mogu biti kreirane i mijenjane u &rocs;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In general &rocs; works with projects: when opening &rocs; an empty project "
"is created and you can replace it by loading or importing another project. "
"Hereby, a project itself consists of <emphasis>graph documents</emphasis> "
"and <emphasis>scripts</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Općenito &rocs; radi sa projektima; kad se otvara &rocs; prazan projekat se "
"kreira i možete ga zamijeniti učitavanjem drugog projekta. Stoga je projekt "
"sastavljen od  <emphasis>graf documenti</emphasis> i <emphasis>skripte</"
"emphasis>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Graph Documents and Data Structure Backends"
msgstr "Graf dokumenti i podrška strukturama podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A graph document represents the content of a whiteboard in the visual graph "
"editor. Hereby, a graph document can contain several data structures at "
"once, but only one data structure backends. Data structure backends are "
"present for several graph types (general graphs, linked lists, rooted trees) "
"and provide for their specific graph types additional functionality. That "
"can be automatic positioning of the elements, special icon sets, or an "
"extended set of script functions for use in your algorithms. (for details "
"look at the corresponding handbook section). It is possible to change the "
"data structure backend of a graph document, though information can be lost "
"(e.g., edges of a circle in a general graph won't be added to a tree, if you "
"switch to the rooted tree backend)."
msgstr ""
"Graf dokument predstavlja sadržaj bijele ploče u vizualnom graf uređivaču. "
"Stoga graf dokument može sadržati više struktura podataka odjednom, ali samo "
"jednu podršku strukturama podataka. Podrške strukturama podataka su prisutne "
"za više tipova podataka (opće grafove, povezane liste, osnovna stabla) i "
"omogućavaju dodatnu funkcionalnost za svoj specifični graf. To može biti "
"automatsko pozicioniranje elemenata, specijalne setove ikona, ili produžene "
"setove skripti funkcija za upotrebu u vašim algoritmima.(za detaljanije "
"objašnjenje pogledajte odgovarajući odjeljak uputstva). Moguće je "
"promjeniti  podršku strukturama podataka graf dokumenta, iako informacije "
"mogu biti izgubljene (npr. ivice krugova u generalnom grafu neće biti dodate "
"stablu, ako se prebacite na podršku baznog stabla)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Graph documents form also the base for defining pointer types and data types."
msgstr ""
"Graf dokument forma je osnovna forma za definiranje tipova pokazivača i "
"tipova podataka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid "Data Structures"
msgstr "Strukture podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Data structures are the base of all work in &rocs;. You can add one or "
"several of them to a graph document, add data elements (nodes, datums) and "
"pointers to them, and modify them by scripts. For this, each data structure "
"has its unique name by which it can be accessed from your scripts. Due to "
"your choice of the current data structure backend it can happen that you "
"cannot modify the data structures arbitrarily (e.g., a tree should never "
"contain a cycle). The data structure backend is determined by the data "
"structure backend associated with the corresponding graph document that "
"contains the data structure."
msgstr ""
"Strukture podataka su osnova za cijeli posao &rocs;. Možete dodati jedan od "
"više  njih graf dokumentu, dodati elemente podataka (čvorove,datume) i "
"pokazivače na njih, i modificirati ih skriptom. Za ovo svaka struktura ima "
"jedinstveno ime po kojem joj je moguće pristupiti iz skripti. Pri izboru "
"trenutne podrške za strukture podataka može se desiti da ne možete "
"jednostavno modificirati strukture podataka (npr. stablo nikad ne smije "
"sadržavati ciklus). Podrška strukturi podataka je određena podrškom "
"strukturi podatka određenom odgovarajućim graf dokumentom koji sadrži "
"strukturu podataka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer Types"
msgstr "Tipovi pokazivača"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By pointer types you can define different types of pointers to be used in "
"your data structures. This is, a pointer type can get an individual layout "
"(essentially a color) and it is easy to access only pointers of a specific "
"type from your scripts. Typical use cases for pointers can be to implement "
"meta-edges at your data structures that visualize relationships between data "
"elements (e.g., visualize communication interests). But also, if your "
"scripts shall identify specific kinds of edges (e.g., tree and cross edges "
"at the depth first search algorithm), pointer types can be an elegant way to "
"implement that."
msgstr ""
"Kod tipova podataka možete definisati tipove pokazivača koji će se koristiti "
"u vašim strukturama podataka. To jest, tip pokazivača može imati "
"individualni izgled(obično boju) i lako je pristupiti pokazivačima "
"specifičnog tipa iz vaših skripti. Tipično korištene vrste za pokazivače se "
"implementiraju u meta-ivice u vašim strukturama podataka koji vizualizira "
"odnos između elemenata podataka(npr. vizualizira komunikacijske interese). "
"Ali također, ako vaša skripta treba identificirati specifičnu vrstu ivica"
"(npr. stablo i unakrsne ivice na dnu prvog pretraživačkog algoritma), tipovi "
"pokazivača mogu biti elegantan način za implementaciju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Data Types"
msgstr "Tipovi podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In several data structure problems, a set of data elements should be parted "
"into groups of different types (e.g., clustering problems or covering "
"problems). Or it is useful for the execution of an algorithm to specify a "
"data element type to express a specific type (e.g., breath first search). "
"For such use cases you can define data types. Each data type has its own "
"icon and data types of some type can easily be accessed from your scripts."
msgstr ""
"Za više problema sa strukturama podataka, set elemenata podataka bi trebao "
"biti podijeljenj u grupe različitih tipova (npr. grupisanje problema ili "
"prikrivanje problema). Ili da li je korisno za izvršavanje algoritma da se "
"specificiraju tipovi podataka da se prikaže specifični tip (npr. prva "
"pretraga). Za takvu upotrebu možete definirati tipove podataka. Svaki tip "
"podataka ima vlastitu ikonu i tipovi podataka neko tipa mogu biti  "
"pregledani i može im se pristupiti iz vaših skripti."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dynamic Properties"
msgstr "Dinamička svojstva"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every data element and pointer can have many properties. Some of these "
"properties are default from data structure backend. See the documentation of "
"the data structure backend for more details. To add further properties to "
"the data elements and pointers, you can add <emphasis>dynamic properties</"
"emphasis> to them. Each dynamic property is identified by its name and can "
"contain any value associated with it. The name must start with a letter (a-z "
"or A-Z) and can contain only letters, numbers and '_'. If you try to use any "
"invalid character in the property name, the property will not be changed."
msgstr ""
"Svaki element podataka i pokazivača ima mnoge osobine. Neke od tih osobina "
"su zadane kao podrška strukturama podataka. Vidjeti dokumentaciju podrške "
"strikturama podataka  za više detalja. Za dodavanje novih osobina elementima "
"podataka i pokazivačima možete im  dodati <emphasis>dinamičke osobine</"
"emphasis>. Svaka dinamička osobina je identifikovana imenom i može "
"sadržavati bilo koju vrijednost povezanu sa njom. Ime mora počinjati slovom "
"(a-z ili A-Z) i može sadržavati samo slova ,brojeve i '_'. Ako pokušate "
"koristiti znak koji nije dozvoljen u imenu osobine , osobina neće biti "
"promijenjena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add dynamic properties, use the <guilabel>Data Element Properties</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>Pointer Properties</guilabel> dialogs from the "
"context menus of the respective elements or the script functions as "
"explained in <xref linkend=\"scripting-data-structure\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Za dodavanje dinamičkih osobina koristite  <guilabel>Osobine elemenata "
"podataka</guilabel> i  <guilabel>Osobine pokazivača</guilabel> okvire iz "
"menija sa sadržajem odgovarajućih elemenata ili koristite funkcije iz "
"skripte objašnjene u <xref linkend=\"scripting-data-structure\"/>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also use the scripts. You just need to use the "
"<literal>add_property</literal> with the name and value of your property. "
"After that, you can use node/pointer.propertyName to set/get the values."
msgstr ""
"Također,možete koristiti i skripte. Samo trebate primijeniti "
"<literal>dodaj_osobinu</literal> sa imenom i vrijednošću vaše osobine. Nakon "
"toga možete koristiti čvor/pokazivač.imeosobine da postavite/dobijete "
"vrijednosti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is an example of how to use dynamic properties with data structure "
"backend \"Graph\"."
msgstr ""
"Evo primjera kako koristiti dinamičke osobine sa podrškom strukturama "
"podataka tipa \"Graf\"."

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"nodes = myGraph.list_nodes()\n"
"for (var i = 0; i &lt; nodes.length; ++i ){\n"
"    nodes[i].add_property(\"MyProperty\", 0)\n"
"}\n"
"nodes[0].MyProperty = 2\n"
"nodes[1].MyProperty = nodes[0].MyProperty + 2"
msgstr ""
"nodes = myGraph.list_nodes()\n"
"for (var i = 0; i &lt; nodes.length; ++i ){\n"
"    nodes[i].add_property(\"MyProperty\", 0)\n"
"}\n"
"nodes[0].MyProperty = 2\n"
"nodes[1].MyProperty = nodes[0].MyProperty + 2"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "Tutorijal"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this section we want to create an example project to explore some of the "
"most important functions of &rocs;. The goal is to create a graph and a "
"script that illustrates a simple 2-approximate algorithm for the "
"<emphasis>minimum vertex cover</emphasis> problem. The minimum vertex cover "
"problem is the problem to find a subset of graph nodes C of minimal size "
"such that each graph edge is connected to at least one node in C. This "
"problem is known to be NP-hard and we want to illustrate how to find an "
"approximation of factor 2 by finding a matching in the given graph (in the "
"following we use the common terms for graph algorithms: graph is the data "
"structure, nodes are the data elements, edges are the pointers)."
msgstr ""
"Uovom dijelu želimo kreirati primjer projekta da bismo istražili neke od "
"najvažnijih funkcija u &rocs;. Cilj je kreirati graf i skriptu koja "
"ilustrira jednostavni 2-aproksimativni algoritam za problem "
"<emphasis>minimalnog pokrivanja tjemena  </emphasis>. Problem minimalnog "
"pokrivanja tjemena je problem pronalaženja podskupa čvorova grafa minimalne "
"veličine tako da je svaka ivica grafa povezana sa bar jednim čvorom u C. "
"Ovaj problem je poznat kao NP-težak i želimo ilustrirati kako peonaći "
"aproksimaciju faktora 2 pronalaženjem parova u datom grafu (u nastavku "
"koristimo standardne termine za graf algoritme : graf je struktura podataka "
"čvorovi su elementi podataka a ivice pokazivači)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Our goal is to visualize the correspondence of the matching and the minimum "
"vertex cover. For this, we want to specify two pointer types, one to display "
"matching edges and one type to display ordinary edges, as well as two data "
"types that we use to distinguish nodes contained in C and those not "
"contained in C."
msgstr ""
"Cilj je vizualizirati podudaranje odgovarajućeg i minimalnog pokrivanja "
"tjemena. Za ovo želimo specificirati dva tipa pokazivača, jedan za prikaz "
"odgovarajućih ivica a drugi za prikaz običnih ivica, kao i dva tipa podataka "
"koje koristimo za razlikovanje čvorova sadržanih u C i onih koji nisu  u C."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate a Graph"
msgstr "Generiši Graf"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For the data structure backend <quote>Graph</quote>, &rocs; ships a helper "
"tool that can generate graphs. We go to <menuchoice><guimenu>Graph Document</"
"guimenu> <guisubmenu>Tools</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Generate Graph</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. There we generate a <guilabel>Random Graph</"
"guilabel> with 30 nodes, 90 edges, and with seed 1 (the seed is the starting "
"seed for the random graph generator; using the same seed multiple times "
"results in same and reproducible graphs). Finally, we modify the graph name "
"at the data structure panel and call the graph <literal>testgraph</literal>."
msgstr ""
"Za podrškun strukturama podataka tipa <quote>Graf</quote>, &rocs; pokreće "
"alat za pomoć koji može generisati grafove.Idemo u  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Graf Dokument</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Alati</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Generiši  Graf</guimenuitem></menuchoice>.Tu generišemo "
"<guilabel>Slučajni Graf</guilabel> sa  30 čvorova, 90 ivica, i 1 zrnom (zrno "
"je početak generatora slučajnog grafa , korištenjem istog zrna više puta "
"dobija se isti umnožen graf). Konačno modificiramo ime grafa unutar panela "
"strukture podataka i pozovemo graf <literal>testgraf</literal>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create Types"
msgstr "Kreiranje tipova"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We use the <guibutton>Properties</guibutton> buttons at the Document "
"Selector bar to open the properties dialog for data and pointer types of the "
"current graph document. For the data types we add a new type called \"C\", "
"which automatically gets ID <literal>1</literal>. For this type we select "
"the server picture as icon. Furthermore, we switch to the pointer type page "
"and add a new pointer type called \"matching\". This gets automatically ID "
"<literal>1</literal> and we set the color to blue."
msgstr ""
"Koristimo <guibutton>Osobine</guibutton> tipke u traci izbornika  dokumenata "
"da otvorite okvir sa osobinama za podatkovne i pokazivačke tipove trenutnog "
"graf dokumenta.Za tipove podataka dodajemo novi tip nazvan \"C\", koji "
"automatski dobija ID  <literal>1</literal>.Za ovaj tip biramo sliku servera "
"kao ikonu. Nadalje, prebacujemo na stranicu sa pokazivačkim tipom i dodajemo "
"novi pokazivački tip nazvan \"odgovarajući\".Ovo automatski dobija ID "
"<literal>1</literal> i postavljamo plavu boju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritam"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At last we have to implement the approximation algorithm. For this we use "
"the following implementation:"
msgstr ""
"U konačnici moramo implementirati algoritam aproksimacije. Za ovo koristimo "
"sljedeću implementaciju:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"var E = testgraph.list_edges(); // set of unprocessed edges\n"
"var C = new Array();            // matching edges\n"
"while (E.length > 0) {\n"
"    var e = E[0];        // we take first edge e={u,v}\n"
"    var u = e.start();\n"
"    var v = e.end();\n"
"    e.set_type(1);        // set edge to be a matching edge\n"
"    E.shift();            // remove e (i.e., E[0]) from edge list\n"
"    C.push(u);            // add u to C\n"
"    C.push(v);            // add v to C\n"
"\n"
"    // mark u,v as nodes in C\n"
"    u.set_type(1);\n"
"    v.set_type(1);\n"
"\n"
"    // remove from E all edges incident to u or v\n"
"    var adjacent = u.adj_edges();\n"
"    for (var i=0; i &lt; adjacent.length; i++) {\n"
"        var index = E.indexOf(adjacent[i]); // find the index\n"
"        if (index!=-1) {\n"
"            E.splice(index, 1); // remove it if really found\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"    var adjacent = v.adj_edges();\n"
"    for (var i=0; i &lt; adjacent.length; i++) {\n"
"        var index = E.indexOf(adjacent[i]); // find the index\n"
"        if (index!=-1) {\n"
"            E.splice(index, 1); // remove it if really found\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"Console.log(\"Vertex Cover contains \" + C.length + \" nodes.\");"
msgstr ""
"var E = testgraph.list_edges(); // set of unprocessed edges\n"
"var C = new Array();            // matching edges\n"
"while (E.length > 0) {\n"
"    var e = E[0];        // we take first edge e={u,v}\n"
"    var u = e.start();\n"
"    var v = e.end();\n"
"    e.set_type(1);        // set edge to be a matching edge\n"
"    E.shift();            // remove e (i.e., E[0]) from edge list\n"
"    C.push(u);            // add u to C\n"
"    C.push(v);            // add v to C\n"
"\n"
"    // mark u,v as nodes in C\n"
"    u.set_type(1);\n"
"    v.set_type(1);\n"
"\n"
"    // remove from E all edges incident to u or v\n"
"    var adjacent = u.adj_edges();\n"
"    for (var i=0; i &lt; adjacent.length; i++) {\n"
"        var index = E.indexOf(adjacent[i]); // find the index\n"
"        if (index!=-1) {\n"
"            E.splice(index, 1); // remove it if really found\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"    var adjacent = v.adj_edges();\n"
"    for (var i=0; i &lt; adjacent.length; i++) {\n"
"        var index = E.indexOf(adjacent[i]); // find the index\n"
"        if (index!=-1) {\n"
"            E.splice(index, 1); // remove it if really found\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"Console.log(\"Vertex Cover contains \" + C.length + \" nodes.\");"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "Execute the Algorithm"
msgstr "Izvrši algoritam"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally we want to execute the algorithm. For this we can start the "
"execution by the <guibutton>Run</guibutton> button at the script control "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"Na kraju želimo izvršiti algoritam. Izvršavanje možemo pokrenuti tipkom   "
"<guibutton>Pokreni</guibutton>  u kontrolnoj ploči za skripte."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &rocs; User Interface"
msgstr "&rocs; Korisničko okruženje"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Elements of the User Interface"
msgstr "Opšti elemeni korisničkog okruženja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The user interface is divided into several logical parts as presented at the "
"screenshot below."
msgstr ""
"Korisničko okruženje je podijeljeno u nekoliko dijelova što se vidi na "
"snimci ekrana ispod."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&GUI; elements of the &rocs; interface.</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&GUI; elementi  &rocs; okruženja.</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&GUI; elements of the &rocs; interface.</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&GUI; elementi &rocs; okruženja.</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "Document Selector"
msgstr "Izbornik dokumenta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At this top menubar you must select the current document and data structure. "
"Creating and deleting of data structures as well as access to data structure "
"properties is also possible there."
msgstr ""
"U ovoj meni traci na vrhu morate izabrati trenutni dokument i strukturu "
"podataka. Kreiranje i brisanje struktura podataka kao i pristup njihovim "
"osobinama je moguć u toj traci."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "Visual Graph Editor"
msgstr "Vizualni uređivač grafa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the whiteboard at which data structures can be created and modified. "
"Right click at the whiteboard, at data elements, or at pointers to open "
"context menus. You can use the tools from the <emphasis>Visual Graph Editor "
"Toolbar</emphasis> to modify the elements at the visual graph editor "
"whiteboard."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je bijela ploča u kojoj strukture podataka mogu biti kreirane i "
"mijenjane. Desnim klikom na bijelu ploču, element podatka , ili pokazivač "
"otvarate meni sa  sdržajem. Možete koristiti alate iz <emphasis>Alatna traka "
"vizualnog uređivača grafa </emphasis> da modifikujete elemente u bijeloj "
"ploči vizualnog uređivača grafa."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "Visual Graph Editor Toolbar"
msgstr "Alatna traka vizualnog uređivača grafa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This toolbar provides all tools for the visual graph editor. Use the "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"hi22-action-rocsadddata."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject> </inlinemediaobject><guibutton>Add "
"Element</guibutton> or <inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"hi22-action-rocsaddedge.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></"
"inlinemediaobject><guibutton>Add Connection</guibutton> buttons to create "
"new elements or to connect elements, respectively. New data elements are "
"added to the data structure that is currently selected at the "
"<emphasis>Document Selector</emphasis> bar. Note that <guibutton>Add "
"Element</guibutton> and <guibutton>Add Connection</guibutton> buttons both "
"have menus to select the type of which the created elements shall be. For "
"details see <xref linkend=\"user-interface-toolbars\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ova alatna traka sadrži sav alat za vizualno uređivanje grafa.Koristite "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"hi22-action-rocsadddata."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject> </inlinemediaobject><guibutton>Dodaj "
"element</guibutton> ili <inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"hi22-action-rocsaddedge.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></"
"inlinemediaobject><guibutton>Dodaj vezu</guibutton> tipke da kreirate nove "
"elemente ili da povežete elemente,respektivo. Novi elementi podataka se "
"dodaju stukturama podataka koje su trenutno odabrane u <emphasis>Izbornik "
"dokumenata</emphasis> traci. Primijetite da <guibutton>Dodaj element</"
"guibutton> i <guibutton>Dodaj vezu</guibutton> tipke imaju menije za izbor "
"tipa kreiranih elemenata.Za detalje pogledati <xref linkend=\"user-interface-"
"toolbars\"/>."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid "Side Bar"
msgstr "Traka sa strane"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the right, you can find the side bar that provides several tools for your "
"workflow:"
msgstr ""
"Desno možete pronaći traku sa strane koja sadrži više alata za vaš rad:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Element Types: This widget gives you direct access to the available pointer "
"and data types."
msgstr ""
"Tipovi elemenata: Ovaj dodatak omogućava direktni pristup pokazivačima i "
"tipovima podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Journal: Each project has its own journal that can be used to, &eg; note "
"tasks, results, or observations."
msgstr ""
"Dnevnik: Svaki projekat ima vlastiti dnevnik koji može biti korišten, npr "
"zapis zadataka rezultata i posmatranja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Handbook: To get direct access to the handbook and by this to the script "
"documentation, you can open this widget."
msgstr ""
"Priručnik: Za direktan pristup priručniku i skripti sa dokumentacijom, "
"možete otvoriti ovaj dodatak."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scripting API: To get direct access to the script documentation, you can "
"open this widget."
msgstr ""
"API za skriptanje : Za direktan pristup skripti sa dokumentacijom možete "
"otvoriti ovaj dodatak."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "Script Editor"
msgstr "Uređivač skripti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this text editor you can write algorithms as explained in detail in <xref "
"linkend=\"scripting\"/>. You can work on several script documents "
"simultaneously by using several tabs. The disk symbol at a tab appears if "
"the script contains unsaved changes."
msgstr ""
"U ovom uređivaču skripti možete pisati algoritme što je detaljno objašnjeno "
"u  <xref linkend=\"scripting\"/>. Možete raditi na više dokumenata skripte "
"istovremeno korištenjem više kartica.Simbol diska u kartici će se pojaviti "
"ako skripta sadrži nesačuvane promjene."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Script Output</term>"
msgstr "<term>Izlaz iz skripte</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This text area either shows debug information or the script output of your "
"algorithm, depending on the toggled setting at the top of this widget. If "
"the script throws an error, automatically the debug output is presented."
msgstr ""
"Ovo područje sa tekstom pokazuje ili informaciju o debagiranju ili izlaz iz "
"skripte vašeg algoritma, zavisno od toga šta je zadano na vrhu dodatka. Ako "
"skripta vrati grešku, automatski se prikazuje izlaz iz debagera."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "Kontrole"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can find the controls for executing scripts. You can execute the "
"script that is currently open at the script editor by pressing <guiicon>Run</"
"guiicon>. While the script is executed, it is possible to stop execution by "
"pressing the <guiicon>Stop</guiicon> button. Note that the <guibutton>One "
"Step</guibutton> execution only stops at specific keywords (see <xref "
"linkend=\"scripting\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete pronaći kontrole za skripte koje se izvršavaju. Možete izvršiti "
"skriptu koja je trenutno otvorena u  uređivaču skripti pritiskom na "
"<guiicon>Pokreni</guiicon>. kada je skripta izvršena moguće je zaustaviti "
"izvršavanje pritiskom na <guiicon>Stop</guiicon> tipku. Primijetite da  "
"<guibutton>Jedan korak</guibutton> zaustavlja skriptu specifičnim ključnim "
"riječima (vidjeti <xref linkend=\"scripting\"/>)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toolbars"
msgstr "Alatne trake"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are different toolbars for the visual graph editor that allow you to "
"access features by only one click. Per default, the following toolbars are "
"shown:"
msgstr ""
"Postoje različite alatne trake za vizualno uređivanje grafa koje omogućavaju "
"pristup dodacima pomoću samo jednog klika.Zadano su prikazane sljedeće "
"alatne trake :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Main Toolbar</para>"
msgstr "<para>Glavna alatna traka</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Alignment Toolbar</para>"
msgstr "<para>Alatna traka za poravnanje</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Main Toolbar</title>"
msgstr "<title>Glavna Alatna Traka</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>Main Toolbar</emphasis> consists of the following actions. "
"Clicking at an action means that your mouse pointer applies this action at "
"the visual graph editor whiteboard:"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Glavna alatna traka</emphasis> se sastoji od sljedećih naredbi. "
"Pritiskom na narednu označava da vaš pokazivač miša primjenjuje naredbu u "
"bijeloj ploči vizulnog uređivača grafa:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Move</guilabel>: To select elements, either click at unused space "
"at the whiteboard, keep the mouse pressed and draw a rectangle that contains "
"some data elements and/or pointers to select these elements or otherwise "
"directly click at an unselected element to select this element. If you click "
"at a selected element or a set of selected elements, respectively, by "
"keeping the mouse pressed and moving around you can move these elements. "
"Moving selected elements is also possible with the arrow keys."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Premjesti</guilabel>: Za odabir elemenata, ili kliknit na "
"nekorišteni prostor na bijeloj ploči držite tipku miša pritisnutom i "
"iscrtajte pravougonik koji sadrži elemente podataka i/ili pokazivače za "
"odabir ovih elemenata ili direktno pritisnite na neodabrani element da ga "
"odaberete. Ako pritisnete odabrani element ili skup odabranih elemenata "
"respektivno, držanjem tipke miša pritisnutom i pomijeranjem možete pomjeriti "
"ove elemente.Pomijeranje elemenata je moguće i sa strelicama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Add Element</guilabel>: Click at an arbitrary position at the "
"visual graph editor whiteboard to create a new data element that belongs to "
"the currently selected data structure. By keeping the mouse pointer pressed "
"at the button, a menu shows up at which the data type of the new created "
"data elements can be selected (only if different data types exist)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Dodaj element</guilabel>: Pritisnite na željenu poziciju u "
"vizualnom uređivaču grafa da kreirate novi element podataka koji pripada "
"trenutno odabranoj strukturi podataka. Ako držite tipku miša pritisnutom, "
"prikazaće se, meni u kojem  možete odabrati tip kreiranih elemenata podatka "
"( samo ako postoje različiti tipovi podataka )."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Add Connection</guilabel>: Click at one data element, keep the "
"mouse pressed and draw a line to another data element to which the pointer/"
"edge shall point. This action is only successful if the current graph allows "
"to add this edge (&eg;, in an undirected graph you are not allowed to add "
"multiple edges between two data elements). By keeping the mouse pointer "
"pressed at the button, a menu shows up at which the pointer type of the new "
"created pointers can be selected (only if different pointer types exist)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Dodaj vezu</guilabel>: Pritisnite na jedan element podatka, držite "
"tipku miša pritisnutom i nacrtajte liniju do sljedećeg elementa podatka na "
"koji pokazivač/ivica treba pokazivati. Ova akcija će biti uspješno izvršena "
"ako graf dozvoljava dodavanje ivice (u neuređenom grafu nije dozvoljeno "
"dodavanje višestrukih ivica između dva elementa podatka). Ako držite tipku "
"miša pritisnutom, prikazaće se, meni u kojem  možete odabrati tip kreiranih "
"elemenata podatka ( samo ako postoje različiti tipovi podataka )."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Delete</guilabel>: Click at an element to delete it. If you delete "
"a node, all adjacent edges are also deleted."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Obriši</guilabel>: Pritisnite na element da ga obrišete. Ako "
"obrišete čvor sve pridružene ivice će biti obrisane."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Zoom</guilabel>: Click at the whiteboard, keep the &LMB; pressed, "
"and by this draw a rectangle. The whiteboard will be zoomed to the selected "
"area. Using the mousewheel to zoom in or out as well. A double click with "
"the &LMB; restores the original zoom."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Zoom</guilabel>: Pritisnite na bijelu ploču ,držite &LMB; "
"pritisnutim , i pomoću ovoga nacrtajte pravougaonik. Bijela ploča će biti "
"zumirana u odabranom dijelu. Koristite točkić miša za povećavanje ili "
"smanjivanje. Dupli klik &LMB; vraća početno zumiranje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Alignment Toolbar</title>"
msgstr "<title>Alatna traka za poravnanje </title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can add the optional <emphasis>Alignment Toolbar</emphasis>. Pressing an "
"action at this toolbar has direct effect to the currently selected nodes:"
msgstr ""
"Ako želite možete dodati <emphasis>Alatna traka za poravnanje </emphasis>. "
"Pritiskanjem naredbi u ovoj alatnoj traci ima direktni uticaj na trenutno "
"odabrane čvorove:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Top</guilabel>: Align the data elements at the vertical position "
"of the top-most data element. This only affects the vertical positions."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Vrh</guilabel>: poravnava elemente podatka po vertikali na najvišu "
"gornju poziciju. Ovo ima efekta samo na vertikalnu poziciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Center</guilabel>: Align the data elements at the vertical "
"position given by the center of all selected data elements vertical "
"positions. This only affects the vertical positions."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Centar</guilabel>: poravnava elemente podatka po vertikali na "
"centralnu poziciju. Ovo ima efekta samo na vertikalnu poziciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Base</guilabel>: Align the data elements at the vertical position "
"of the bottom-most data element. This only affects the vertical positions."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Dno</guilabel>: poravnava elemente podatka po vertikali na najvišu "
"donju poziciju. Ovo ima efekta samo na vertikalnu poziciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Left</guilabel>: Align the data elements at the horizontal "
"position of the left-most data element. This only affects the horizontal "
"positions."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Lijevo</guilabel>: poravnava elemente podatka po horizontali na "
"najdalju lijevu poziciju. Ovo ima efekta samo na horizontalnu poziciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:379
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Center</guilabel>: Align the data elements at the horizontal "
"position of the top-most data element. This only affects the horizontal "
"positions."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Centar</guilabel>: poravnava elemente podatka po horizontali na "
"najvišu centralnu poziciju. Ovo ima efekta samo na horizontalnu poziciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:385
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Right</guilabel>: Align the data elements at the horizontal "
"position of the right-most data element. This only affects the horizontal "
"positions."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Desno</guilabel>: poravnava elemente podatka po horizontali na "
"najdalju desnu poziciju. Ovo ima efekta samo na horizontalnu poziciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:390
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Circle</guilabel>: Aligns the data elements at a circle of "
"diameter equals to the maximal distance of the data elements. The data "
"elements are positioned in the same sequence as given by view from the "
"center of gravity of these data elements."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kružno</guilabel>: Poravnjava elemente podatka u krug poluprečnika "
"koji je jednak maksimalnoj udaljenosti među elementima podatka. Elementi "
"podatka su pozicionairani u isti redoslijed kada se posmatra iz težišta ovih "
"elemenata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:395
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Minimize Crossing Edges</guilabel>: Rearrange the selected data "
"elements to minimize the number of crossing connections (application of the "
"Fruchterman-Reingold algorithm)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Minimiziraj prelazne ivice </guilabel>: Sortira odabrane elemente "
"podatka da bi minimizirao prelazne veze (primjena Fruchterman-Reingold "
"algoritma)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:403
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with Graph Documents"
msgstr "Rad sa graf dokumentima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:404
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A &rocs; project contains one or multiple graph documents that can be edited "
"with the visual graph editor. Further, each document can contain an "
"arbitrary number of data structures. Here, data structures of a document all "
"use the same data structure backend. This section will explain how to switch "
"between documents and how to create new ones."
msgstr ""
"&rocks; projekat sadrži jedan ili više graf dokumenata koji mogu biti "
"uređeni sa vizualnim graf uređivačem. Nadalje, svaki dokument sadrži određen "
"broj struktura podataka. Ovdje strukture podataka dokumenta koriste istu "
"podršku strukturama podataka. Ovaj odjeljak će objasniti kako se kretati "
"među dokumentima i kako kreirati nove."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:412
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Document Selector Bar"
msgstr "Traka izbornika dokumenata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The document selector bar is used to select the current graph document and "
"further the current data structure. Using the visual graph editor tools to "
"create data structures elements will automatically add those newly created "
"elements to the current data structure. Also, this bar gives direct access "
"to delete existing or create new data structures within the current document."
msgstr ""
"Traka izbornika dokumenata je korištena za izbor trenutnog dokumenta i "
"trenutne strukture podataka. Korištenjem vizualnog uređivača grafa za "
"kreiranje elemenata struktura podataka će automatski dodati novokreirane "
"dokumente u trenutnu strukturu podataka. Također, ova traka omogućava "
"direktan pristup brisanju postijećih i kreiranju novih struktura podataka "
"unutar trenutnog dokumenta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>New</guilabel>: This action creates a new data structure using an "
"automatic naming pattern given by the data structure backend. The created "
"data structure is added to the currently selected graph document."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Kreiraj</guilabel>: Ova naredba kreira novu strukturu podataka "
"korištenjem automatskog obrasca za imenovanje koji je dat u podršci "
"strukturama podataka. Kreirana struktura podataka je dodata trenutno "
"odabranom graf dokumentu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Delete</guilabel>: This action deletes the data structure that is "
"currently selected in the data structure selector for the current document."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Obriši</guilabel>:  Ova naredba briše strukture podataka odabrane "
"u izborniku struktura podataka za trenutni dokument."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Properties</guilabel> for <guilabel>Graph Document</guilabel>: "
"Open a dialog that gives access to the document properties as well as the "
"data and pointer types of the document."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Osobine</guilabel> za <guilabel>Graf dokument </guilabel>: Otvara "
"okvir koji omogućava pristup osobinama dokumnta kao i tipovima podataka i "
"pokazivača u dokumentu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Properties</guilabel> for <guilabel>Data Structure</guilabel>: "
"Open a dialog that gives access to the data structure properties."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Osobine</guilabel> za <guilabel>Strukture podataka </guilabel>: "
"Otvara okvir koji omogućava pristup osobinama struktura podataka."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:448
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Main Toolbar."
msgstr "Glavna alatna traka."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Document Selector Bar."
msgstr "Traka izbornika dokumenta."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:461
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create and Import Graph Documents"
msgstr "Kreiraj i učitaj graf dokumente"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new graph document or to add an existing one to the project, use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New Project</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> or <menuchoice><guimenu>Graph Document</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Import Graph</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. You can also import "
"graph documents from third party applications (for this, see <xref linkend="
"\"import-export\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Da biste kreirali novi graf dokument ili dodali postojeći u projekat "
"koristite <menuchoice><guimenu>Dokument</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Novi "
"Projekat</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili <menuchoice><guimenu>Graf Dokument</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Učitaj graf</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Možete učitati "
"graf dokumente iz neke treće aplikacije(za ovo pogledati<xref linkend="
"\"import-export\"/>)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:473
#, no-c-format
msgid "Writing and Executing Algorithms in &rocs;"
msgstr "Pisanje i izvršavanje algoritama u &rocs;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:475
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&rocs; internally uses the QtScript scripting engine, which is a specific "
"JavaScript engine. This means, all algorithms that you implement must use "
"JavaScript. How JavaScript works and how to write JavaScript code is not "
"covered in this handbook, though we explain how to access data structures, "
"data elements and pointers of your data structures from the scripting "
"engine. Since you never use the basic data structure object but one that is "
"provided by the currently used data structure backend, the functionality of "
"the data structure is extended by the corresponding backend and you should "
"have a look at the specialized functionality. Especially, data structure "
"backends use the common terms from their domain (nodes and edges in graphs, "
"leafs and roots in trees, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"&rocs; interno koristi pogon za skriptanje QtScript, sa specifičnim "
"JavaScript pogon. To znači, svi algoritmi koje implementirate "
"morajukoristiti JavaScript. Kako JavaScript radi i kako pisati JavaScript "
"kôd nije obuhvaćeno  ovim priručnikom, iako smo objasniti kako pristupiti "
"strukturama podataka, elementima podatka i pokazivačima na vaše strukture "
"podataka iz pogona za skriptanje. Budući da nikada ne koristite podršku "
"osnovnoj strukturi podataka, ali onaj koji je omogućen trenutno korištenom "
"strukturaom podataka, funkcionalnost strukture podataka je proširena "
"odgovarajućom podrškom i trebati imati uvid u specijaliziranu "
"funkcionalnost. Posebno,podrške strukturama podataka koriste zajedničke "
"termine iz njihovih domena (čvorovi i ivica u grafu, lišće i korijenje u "
"drveću, itd)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:482
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is important to know that changes done by the scripting engine are "
"directly reflected at the properties at the visual graph editor whiteboard. "
"Hence, the scripts actually modify the data structures."
msgstr ""
"Bitno je znati da promjene koje izvrši pogon za skriptanje imaju direktan "
"utjecaj na osobine u bijeloj ploci vizualnog uređivača grafa. Zapravo, "
"skripte mijenjaju strukture podataka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:489
#, no-c-format
msgid "Controlling the Script Execution"
msgstr "Kontrola izvršavanja skripte"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:494
#, no-c-format
msgid "Include Files"
msgstr "Uključi dokumente"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your script documents can include other scripts. This can be useful to "
"reduce the size of script documents and improve readability. Using "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Script Document</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Possible "
"Includes</guimenuitem></menuchoice> you get a list of script files already "
"shipped with &rocs; that could be included. You can include a script file "
"with the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Dokumenti vaše skripte mogu uključiti druge skripte. Ovo može biti korisno "
"za smanjenje veličine skripti i poboljšanje čitljivosti. Korištenjem  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Skripta dokument </guimenu> <guimenuitem>Moguće "
"uključiti</guimenuitem></menuchoice> dobićete listu skripti pokrenutih "
"unutar &rocs; koje mogu biti uključene. Skriptu možete uključiti korištenjem "
"sljedeće naredbe:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:501
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"include_script(string path);            // relative or absolute path to "
"script file"
msgstr "include_script(string path); // relativni apsolutni put do skripte"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Script Output</title>"
msgstr "<title>Izlaz skripte</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:506
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"During the execution of an algorithm, debug and program output is displayed "
"in the <emphasis>Debug &amp; Script Output</emphasis>. If the scripting "
"engine detects a syntax error in your script, the error is also displayed as "
"debug message. Note that all program messages are also displayed at the "
"debug output (displayed as bold text)."
msgstr ""
"Tokom izvršavanja algoritma prikazuju se izlazi iz debagera i programa u "
"<emphasis>Debager &amp; Skripta izlaz</emphasis>. Ako pogon za skriptanje "
"otkrije sintaksnu grešku u skripti ,greška je također prikazana kao poruka "
"debagera. Primijetite da su sve poruke programa također prikazane na izlazu "
"debagera (prikazano kao podebljan tekst)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:511 index.docbook:522
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can control the text that is displayed at the script output by the "
"following functions:"
msgstr ""
"Prikazani tekst na izlazu skripte možete kontrolisati sljedećim funkcijama :"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:514
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Console.log(string message);            // displays the message as script "
"output\n"
"    Console.debug(string message);          // displays the message as debug "
"output"
msgstr ""
"Console.log(string message);            // displays the message as script "
"output\n"
"    Console.debug(string message);          // displays the message as debug "
"output"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:518
#, no-c-format
msgid "Control Script Execution"
msgstr "Kontrola izvršavanja skripte"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:519
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are different execution modes for your scripts."
msgstr "Postoje različiti načini izvršavanja vaše skripte."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:528
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Run</guilabel>: Execute the script until it finishes."
msgstr "<guilabel>Pokreni</guilabel>: Izvrašava skriptu do kraja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:533
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>One Step</guilabel>: Execute script until one step ends. A step "
"ends when the script calls the function <literal>interrupt()</literal>:"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Jedan korak</guilabel>: Izvršava skriptu do kraja jednog koraka. "
"Korak završava kad skripta pozove funkciju <literal>interrupt()</literal>:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid "interrupt();    // ends a step"
msgstr "interrupt();    // završava korak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:540
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Debug</guilabel>: Execute script in debug mode. This opens the "
"QtScript debug dialog."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Debagiraj</guilabel>: Izvršava skriptu u debager modu. Ovo otvara "
"QtScript debager okvir."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:545
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Stop</guilabel>: Stop script execution (only available if a script "
"is executing)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Zaustavi</guilabel>: Zaustavlja izvršavanje skripte (dostupno samo "
"ako se skripta izvršava)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:555
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scripting Engine API"
msgstr "Pogon skriptanja API"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:556
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every backend provides a special set of functions and properties for its "
"data structures and their elements. But also every backend provides the "
"properties and functions that are defined for the base data structure."
msgstr ""
"Svaka podrška obezbjđuje specijalni set funkcija i osobina za svoje "
"strukture podataka i njihove elemente. Ali svaka podrška također obezbjeđuje "
"osobine i funkcije koje su definisane za osnovne strukture podataka."

#. Tag: chapter
#: index.docbook:559
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&apiDatastructure; &apiGraphstructure; &apiLinkedListstructure; "
"&apiRootedTreestructure; &apiConsole;"
msgstr ""
"&apiDatastructure; &apiGraphstructure; &apiLinkedListstructure; "
"&apiRootedTreestructure; &apiConsole;"

